 "comments": {
  "comment": [
   {
    "name": "Comment",
    "title": "",
    "background": "",
    "text": "<p>Thursday, 11/19<br /><br />The good news? Winter is coming. The bad news? It's taking its sweet time. The other good news? There's still plenty of time to get ready for ski season!<br /><br />Based on the current extended forecast and increasingly limited weather windows for snowmaking, we're now targeting an opening during the week of Thanksgiving, rather than this Friday, November 20. Our snowmaking team will continue taking advantage of every opportunity to make snow, and we'll keep evaluating conditions and our progress. We expect to make an official announcement early next week.<br /><br />In the meantime, there's plenty happening around the mountain this Thanksgiving weekend. Whethe"
   }
  ]
 },
